<title>KYRGYZSTAN: Kyrgyz Jan-Oct budget deficit/GDP falls to 5.5 pct.</title>
<headline>Kyrgyz Jan-Oct budget deficit/GDP falls to 5.5 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BISHKEK 1996-12-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Kyrgyzstan's budget deficit narrowed to 989.1 million soms in the first 10 months of the year, or 5.5 percent of gross domestic product, from about 2.09 billion soms a year ago (11.7 percent of GDP), the National Statistics Committee said on Thursday.</p>
<p> KYRGYZ BUDGET	    JAN-OCT 96   JAN-SEP 96   JAN-OCT 95</p>
<p> revenue (million soms)   2,965	  2,658.3	2,091.4</p>
<p> expenditure		  3,954.1	3,344.1	3,525.1</p>
<p> deficit			  989.1	  685.8	1,433.7</p>
<p> percentage of GDP		5.5	    4.6	   11.7</p>
<p>--Almaty Newsroom, + 7 3272 509410</p>
</text>
